&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/anthropics/anthropic-cookbook/blob/main/third_party/Pinecone/rag_using_pinecone.ipynb&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
